---
layout: shell.njk
title: 标签
permalink: /tags/
navKey: tags
---
<div class="page-shell">
  <header class="page-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">// TOPICS</p>
    <h1>阅读专题 <span lang="en">Reading paths</span></h1>
    <p>五条长期更新的阅读路径，先进入一个问题，再沿着文章继续读。</p>
  </header>

  {% if blog.topics.length %}
  <ul class="topic-grid topic-grid--page topic-grid--primary">
    {% for group in blog.topics %}
    <li>
      <a href="/topics/{{ group.slug }}/">
        <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span>
          <strong>{{ group.title }}</strong>
          <small>{{ group.english }} · {{ group.description }}</small>
        </span>
        <b>{{ group.posts.length }}</b>
      </a>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {% else %}
  <p class="empty">还没有主题。</p>
  {% endif %}

  {% if blog.tags.length %}
  <section class="tag-index" aria-labelledby="tag-index-heading">
    <div class="section-label" id="tag-index-heading">全部标签 · INDEX</div>
    <p>标签用于精确定位技术名词；只有一篇文章的标签仍可访问，但不再占据主要导航。</p>
    <div class="tag-cloud">
      {% for group in blog.tags %}
      <a href="/tags/{{ group.tag | tagPath | urlencode }}/">
        <span>#{{ group.tag }}</span><b>{{ group.posts.length }}</b>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}
</div>
